<p>The best Emacs distribution I've found for macOS, is
<a href="https://github.com/d12frosted/homebrew-emacs-plus">emacs-plus</a>.</p>
<h2>Installing Emacs Plus</h2>
<div class="highlight"><pre><span></span><code>$ brew tap d12frosted/emacs-plus
$ brew install emacs-plus@31 --with-imagemagick
</code></pre></div>

<h2>Upgrading Emacs Plus</h2>
<p>There's no real upgrade of emacs with brew, so uninstall it first to
ensure the upgrade goes at intended:</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre><span></span><code><span class="n">$</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">brew</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">uninstall</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">emacs</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">plus</span><span class="mi">@31</span>
<span class="n">$</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">brew</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">install</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">emacs</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">plus</span><span class="mi">@31</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">--</span><span class="n">with</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">imagemagick</span>
</code></pre></div>